{"unit_id":"hhuapen__dsh-per-session-folder#card-zh","repo":"hhuapen/dsh-per-session-folder","commit":"1833e66fd22fd097e7ddca258c4ceb3d7be83cac","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Session Folders 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话文件夹插件，为默认工作区中的新对话建立独立工作目录，并在标题生成或修改后同步文件夹名称。它通过工作目录接口和会话事件接入 DSH，可选择立即创建或等到首条消息再创建，处理重名并在重启后恢复目录。设置面板可选择父目录与创建时机，适合希望隔离不同对话文件操作的用户。无需 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:21-49","index.js:411-450","index.js:557-616","client.js:397-457"]}
{"unit_id":"hhuapen__dsh-per-session-folder#card-en","repo":"hhuapen/dsh-per-session-folder","commit":"1833e66fd22fd097e7ddca258c4ceb3d7be83cac","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Session Folders gives each new DSH Web conversation in the default workspace its own folder and syncs its name with the session title. Users can choose the folder location and whether to create it on open or on the first message. It handles name collisions and restart recovery; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:21-49","index.js:411-450","index.js:557-616","client.js:397-457"]}
